# The same functions, each with one flag or one row taken out of its record, or one word too many in it: each is reported, with the rule that it breaks.
# RUN: verify-relations
# CHECK: f1 b0 IsReturned: subject 0 is operand 0 of Return
# CHECK: f2 b0 IsThrown: subject 0 is operand 0 of Throw
# CHECK: f3 b0 v1 IsStoredInVariable: subject 0 is operand 0 of PutModuleVariable
# CHECK: f4 b0 v1 HasMembersRead: subject 0 is operand 0 of PropGet
# CHECK: f5 b0 v1 ReadIsSubject: subject 0 is operand 0 of PropGet
# CHECK: f6 b0 v2 HasMembersWritten: subject 0 is operand 0 of PropSet
# CHECK: f7 b0 v2 IsStoredIntoOperand: subject 1 is operand 1 of PropSet
# CHECK: f8 b0 v1 IsStoredIntoResult: subject 0 is operand 1 of NewObject
# CHECK: f9 b0 v2 IsHandedToCode: subject 1 is operand 2 of Call
# CHECK: f10 b0 v2 IsCalled: subject 0 is operand 0 of Call
# CHECK: f11 b0 v2 IsCompared: subject 1 is operand 1 of StrictEq
# CHECK: f12 b0 v2 IsConvertedToPrimitive: subject 0 is operand 0 of Add
# CHECK: f13 b0 v1 HasMembersDeletedOrDefined: subject 0 is operand 0 of PropDelete
# CHECK: f14 b0 v2 IsHandedToCode: subject 1 is operand 0 of NewClosure
# CHECK: f15 b3 IsReturned: subject 1 is operand 0 of Return
# CHECK: f16 b0 ResultIsListed: undefined is returned
# CHECK: f17 b0 v1 ResultIsListed: returned by Return
# CHECK: f18 b3 v4 ResultIsListed: returned by Return
# CHECK: f20 b1 IsReturned: subject 0 is operand 0 of Return
# CHECK: f21 b0 v2 IsStoredInUnknownObject: subject 0 is operand 1 of PropSet
# CHECK: f22 b0 v2 StoreHasRow: subject 0 is operand 0 of PropSet
# CHECK: f23 b0 v2 ReadIsSubject: subject 0 is operand 0 of IteratorResume
# CHECK: f24 b0 v2 IsOperandOfUser: subject 1 is operand 1 of ElemGet
# CHECK: f25 b3 v6 IsHandedToCode: what is no subject may be operand 2 of Call
# CHECK: f26 b0 v2 IsIncomplete: subject 1 is operand 2 of Call
# CHECK: f27 v1 KindFitsOperation: subject 1 is PropGet
# CHECK: f28 b0 v2 IsStoredIntoOperand: subject 1 is operand 1 of PropSet
# CHECK: f29 b0 v1 StoreHasRow: subject 0 is operand 0 of PropDelete
# CHECK: f30 b0 v2 ContentsAreSubject: subject 0 is operand 1 of CopyDataProperties
# CHECK: f31 b0 v2 IsHandedToUnknownCode: subject 0 is operand 0 of InstanceOf
# CHECK: f32 b0 v2 IsStoredInUnknownObject: subject 0 is operand 1 of PropSet
# CHECK: f33 b0 v2 IsStoredInUnknownObject: subject 0 is operand 1 of PropSet
# CHECK: f34 b0 v2 ContentsAreSubject: subject 0 is operand 0 of SuperGet
# CHECK-NEXT: f34 b0 v2 HasMembersRead: subject 0 is operand 0 of SuperGet
# CHECK: f35 b0 v1 StoreHasRow: subject 1 is born with more than its rows say
# CHECK: f36 b0 v1 StoreHasRow: subject 0 is born with more than its rows say
# CHECK: f37 b0 v0 StoreHasRow: subject 0 is born with more than its rows say

